    {
      "name": "5. Frozen wallet (manual step first)",
      "description": "There is no endpoint to freeze a wallet (the brief does not ask for one), so freeze wallet B in the database before running this folder. Copy B's id from the collection variable `walletB`, then run:\n\n```\ndocker exec wallet-service-postgres-1 psql -U wallet -d wallet -c \"UPDATE accounts SET status = 'FROZEN' WHERE id = '<walletB>'\"\n```\n\nA frozen wallet cannot send (transfer or bill payment) but can still receive (transfer in, deposit).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Wallet B shows FROZEN [200]",
